          "Hadith.5320 - In the narration of Jamil ibn Darraj from Ubayd ibn Zurarah, he said:\nI asked Abu Abdullah (as): \"The ghurra (compensation for a miscarried fetus) is sometimes valued at one hundred dinars and sometimes at ten dinars.\"\nImam (as) replied: \"It is fifty.\""
